# The collected snapshot is shipped in the repo so a fresh clone can run the
# app. Marked binary explicitly: git's text detection is reliable here, but a
# wrong guess would line-ending-convert the SQLite file and hand judges a
# corrupt database that fails only at startup, in their hands, not ours.
*.db binary

# Everything else normalises to LF in the repo, checked out per platform.
* text=auto
